WEBVTT

00:18:59.688 --> 00:19:01.438
i to je dobra stvar.

00:19:01.708 --> 00:19:04.412
Željela bih da završim
sa starom sufijskom pjesmom:

00:19:04.412 --> 00:19:06.932
"Dođi, budimo prijatelji na trenutak

00:19:06.932 --> 00:19:09.184
olakšajmo živote jedni drugom

00:19:09.184 --> 00:19:11.529
budimo ljubavnici i voljeni

00:19:11.529 --> 00:19:14.145
zemlja neće ostati nikome."

00:19:14.552 --> 00:19:16.184
Hvala vam.

00:19:16.184 --> 00:19:24.252
(Aplauz)